<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Special Circumstances Request</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .header-logo {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .form-row {
            display: flex;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .form-row > div {
            flex: 1;
        }
        .label-col {
            font-weight: bold;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .input-col {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 2px;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .checkbox-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .signature-area {
            margin-top: 50px;
            font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .signature-line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            width: 50%;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="header-logo">
            <span style="font-size: 40px;">&#x2699;&#x2699;&#x2699;</span>
            <h1 style="font-size: 48px; margin: 0;">WESTMONT</h1>
        </div>
        <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-top: 10px;">2022-2023 Special Circumstances Request</h2>

        <div class="section-title">STUDENT INFORMATION</div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <span class="label-col">Last Name</span>
                <div class="input-col">{{ student_info.last_name }}</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label-col">First Name</span>
                <div class="input-col">{{ student_info.first_name }}</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label-col">M.I.</span>
                <div class="input-col">{{ student_info.middle_initial }}</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label-col">Westmont ID Number or Last 4 digits of Social Security Number</span>
                <div class="input-col">{{ student_info.id_number }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <span class="label-col">E-mail Address</span>
                <div class="input-col">{{ student_info.email }}</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="label-col">Student's Cell Phone</span>
                <div class="input-col">{{ student_info.phone }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">GENERALLY REQUIRED DOCUMENTATION</div>
        <p>All requests must include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>2022-2023 Verification Worksheet</li>
            <li>2020 signed copies of Parent and Student Federal Income Tax Returns</li>
            <li>2020 W-2 Form(s)</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="section-title">SUPPLEMENTAL DOCUMENTATION</div>
        <p>Please select the option(s) below that best fits your circumstance and include all of the supplemental documentation listed in addition to the documents listed above. Please also include a signed letter explaining your special circumstance.</p>

        <div class="checkbox-group">
            <label>
                <input type="checkbox"> LOSS OF EMPLOYMENT OR REDUCTION IN EMPLOYMENT/INCOME
            </label>
            <p style="margin-left: 20px;">
                <span class="label-col" style="font-weight: normal;">•</span> Signed copy of the 2021 Tax Return and 2021 W-2 Form(s).
            </p>
            <p style="margin-left: 20px;">
                <span class="label-col" style="font-weight: normal;">•</span> 2022 Projected Income. Please include estimates of all income, including (but not limited to): income earned from work, interest income, rental income, unemployment or retirement income, account distributions, etc.
            </p>
            <p style="margin-left: 20px;">
                <span class="label-col" style="font-weight: normal;">•</span> Copy of documentation relevant to your reduction in income, lay off, or unemployment.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <label>
                <input type="checkbox"> MEDICAL EXPENSES PAID IN 2021
            </label>
            <p style="margin-left: 20px;">
                <span class="label-col" style="font-weight: normal;">•</span> Itemized list of "out of pocket" medical expenses incurred in 2021. Please do not include health insurance premiums.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <label>
                <input type="checkbox"> ONE-TIME INCOME RECEIVED IN 2020
            </label>
            <p style="margin-left: 20px;">
                <span class="label-col" style="font-weight: normal;">•</span> Please indicate the nature of the income that you do not expect to receive again. Attach any relevant documentation.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="signature-area">
            <div class="section-title">SIGNATURE</div>
            <p>By signing this worksheet, we certify that all the information is complete and correct:</p>

            <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 40px;">
                <div style="flex: 1;">
                    <span class="label-col">Student's handwritten signature</span>
                    <div class="signature-line" data-field="student_s_handwritten_signature">{{ student_s_handwritten_signature }}</div>
                </div>
                <div style="flex: 1;">
                    <span class="label-col">Parent's handwritten signature</span>
                    <div class="signature-line" data-field="parent_s_handwritten_signature">{{ parent_s_handwritten_signature }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
                <p>Submit this completed form to:</p>
                <p>Westmont College</p>
                <p>Office of Financial Aid</p>
                <p>955 La Paz Road</p>
                <p>{{ contact_info.address_line_1 }}</p>
                <p>{{ contact_info.city_state_zip }}</p>
                <p>Email: {{ contact_info.email }}</p>
            </div>

            <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Questions? Call our Financial Aid Help Line at {{ contact_info.phone }}.</p>
            <p>Special Circumstances Request</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>